                          <Font Type="MyObjectBuilder_FontDefinition" Subtype="Debug" />
                          <FontSize>1</FontSize>
                          <Text>Kabal has ordered everyone to return for
some meeting. I hate these, they should
have just email us. I dont know whats 
going on, someone mentioned some big 
space hulk was detected drifting into the
solar system coated in traces of wormhole
residue. I wonder if its worth scavenging.
Who knows maybe it will even have a core.</Text>
